This repository embeds glyph outlines from two typefaces, each licensed
under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The outlines live in
src/fonts/glyphs.json, copied from tannergolden/trophies, and in
src/fonts/glyphs-extra.json, extracted from the same fonts by
src/extract-glyphs.py, and are placed into every rendered SVG as paths.
The fonts themselves are not redistributed.

