  SIL Open Font License 1.1: src/fonts/OFL-Cinzel.txt

  Barlow Condensed
  Copyright 2017 The Barlow Project Authors (https://github.com/jpt/barlow)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1: src/fonts/OFL-Barlow-Condensed.txt

The 64 color tokens and 64 line icons in src/bannerkit/palette.py are
copied from the registries of tannergolden/emblems (MIT).

The preview page, preview/preview.html, is built by `make preview` and not
committed. It embeds Brython (https://brython.info), Copyright (c) 2012
Pierre Quentel, under the BSD 3-Clause License, with the Python standard
